					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13855755#post-4814068</guid>
				<title>Why has the Heritage Collection died?: Re: Why has the Heritage Collection died?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13855755/why-has-the-heritage-collection-died#post-4814068</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2020 17:35:51 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>WhiteGuard</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2030383</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It was very controversial with not a lot of people liking the idea. The reasons people didn't like it are numerous, and some searching through the threads will reveal those reasons. Because of that, the Collection was not added to and has since been archived for historical purposes.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13855755#post-4814067</guid>
				<title>Why has the Heritage Collection died?: Re: Why has the Heritage Collection died?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13855755/why-has-the-heritage-collection-died#post-4814067</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2020 17:35:04 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>N_Aepic_Fael</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4463776</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The Heritage Collection was controversial from birth: it was, in practice, more of a popularity thing than anything. If you want to see displays of good SCPs decided by the community, go to <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/user-curated-lists">User Curated Lists</a>. If you want to see something fresh, check out <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/young-and-under-30">Underread and Underrated</a>.</p> <p>Recently, Rewrite Team, which has jurisdiction over this, has decided to remove the rating module from articles and left the page up for posterity: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-752031/heritage-collection-arc#post-4799999">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-752031/heritage-collection-arc#post-4799999</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
				</channel>
</rss>